          "summary": "Search, filter, and page through your repositories",
          "details_markdown": "The dashboard no longer lists every connected repository at once. Each account folds open to its repositories, 20 to a page, in a list that scrolls inside the window. Search by repository name, or pick one account, to narrow every list; the search stays in the address so you can reload or share the filtered view. An organisation's page gets the same search and pages, and the repository checkboxes when you create or edit a project can be filtered by name.\n\nThe \"Free\" label beside each repository is gone; each row now shows whether the repository is public or private.",
